  "_readme": "Declarative complement-rule rows (plan 003 Units 7 & 8). Loaded into the `rules` SQLite table by the importer (via port_graph.rules_schema.seed_rules_db). The RuleInterpreter (Unit 5) compiles each row's JSON predicates to SQL fragments and emits PortComplement records at query time.",
